# Klipper .config seed for the BIGTREETECH SKR Pico (RP2040, serial on UART0 GPIO0/GPIO1).
# Only the choices that matter are listed; Klipper's own `make olddefconfig`
# fills in the rest. Settings follow the header of Klipper's
# config/generic-bigtreetech-skr-pico-v1.0.cfg (RP2040); the serial choice follows BTT's SKR-Pico/Klipper/README.md
# ("Communication Interface: UART0 on GPIO0/GPIO1")
# and Klipper's default RP2040 choices (no bootloader, W25Q080 flash chip).
CONFIG_LOW_LEVEL_OPTIONS=y
CONFIG_MACH_RPXXXX=y
CONFIG_MACH_RP2040=y
CONFIG_RPXXXX_FLASH_START_0100=y
CONFIG_RP2040_FLASH_W25Q080=y
CONFIG_RPXXXX_SERIAL_UART0_PINS_0_1=y
CONFIG_SERIAL_BAUD=250000
